WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.840
You're doing great. Just a little further to go. A few things to keep in mind

2
00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:04.400
tonight.

3
00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:08.330
If you haven't had a bowel movement yet after starting your prep, don't panic.

4
00:00:08.330 --> 00:00:08.640
It can take

5
00:00:08.640 --> 00:00:12.770
a couple of hours to kick in. Keep drinking your clear liquids and stay patient

6
00:00:12.770 --> 00:00:13.360
. Also,

7
00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:18.790
continue to avoid all solid foods and alcohol. And if you're on a split dose

8
00:00:18.790 --> 00:00:20.000
prep, your second

9
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.760
dose is coming up. There's a separate video walking you through that. Lastly,

10
00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:25.040
before you go to sleep,

11
00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:28.340
confirm your arrival time with your driver for tomorrow. You're doing

12
00:00:28.340 --> 00:00:29.120
everything right,

13
00:00:29.120 --> 00:00:30.960
Get some rest and we'll see you soon.
